00:44:11.360 --> 00:44:12.610
Joseph Chamberlain,

00:44:12.610 --> 00:44:15.760
who was secretary of
state for the colonies

00:44:15.760 --> 00:44:19.510
from 1895 to 1903,

00:44:19.510 --> 00:44:24.510
