advocating for a new imperialism.

00:44:25.340 --> 00:44:29.683
And he was the architect of
programs for its implementation.

00:44:30.640 --> 00:44:32.190
He was convinced that Britain

00:44:32.190 --> 00:44:35.785
had to ensure its economic
future and military dominance

00:44:35.785 --> 00:44:40.050
through closer links with the colonies

00:44:40.050 --> 00:44:42.043
and the expansion of empire.

00:44:43.700 --> 00:44:46.410
Chamberlin actually was
the one who organized

00:44:46.410 --> 00:44:51.410
