00:45:01.040 --> 00:45:05.820
how it could be harnessed
for its ideological potential

00:45:05.820 --> 00:45:08.050
to secure the affiliation

00:45:08.050 --> 00:45:10.643
and the allegiance of British citizens.

00:45:13.030 --> 00:45:17.370
Chamberlain financed a
coterie of imperialists men

00:45:17.370 --> 00:45:22.370
