west Indies and the UK.

00:45:58.830 --> 00:46:01.740
Jones was to form a new shipping line,

00:46:01.740 --> 00:46:05.830
The Imperial Direct
West India Mail company

00:46:05.830 --> 00:46:09.100
to run between Bristol and Kingston

00:46:09.100 --> 00:46:13.070
