both as a study of detail

01:00:32.210 --> 01:00:35.340
and as a curious absence of detail.

01:00:35.340 --> 01:00:37.240
We're unable to distinguish any

01:00:37.240 --> 01:00:40.100
of the features of a human face,

01:00:40.100 --> 01:00:44.760
but the palm forms a
sharply defined etched

01:00:44.760 --> 01:00:48.273
in sharp contrast of light and dark.

01:00:50.600 --> 01:00:55.550
We then find ourselves that's a lily pond

01:00:55.550 --> 01:00:59.750
where to Northern eyes, the
abundance and productivity

01:00:59.750 --> 01:01:04.750
of the natural world
verges on the alien chaotic

01:01:05.220 --> 01:01:08.940
and out of control like
the sinister landscape

01:01:08.940 --> 01:01:12.000
of HG Wells is scientific romance,

01:01:12.000 --> 01:01:14.063
the Island of Dr. Moreau.

01:01:15.880 --> 01:01:19.430
Johnston becomes aware of our discomfort

01:01:19.430 --> 01:01:23.500
and our fearfulness ripples
through the auditorium

01:01:23.500 --> 01:01:25.350
as we shifted our seats,

01:01:25.350 --> 01:01:29.080
lower our eyes and lose concentration.

01:01:29.080 --> 01:01:30.400
Beatrice does not know what

01:01:30.400 --> 01:01:32.770
to make of what she sees and feels.

01:01:32.770 --> 01:01:36.063
It's all too overwhelming.

01:01:39.940 --> 01:01:42.600
I leave the auditorium and my grandmother

01:01:42.600 --> 01:01:45.750
and forced myself back
to the university library

01:01:45.750 --> 01:01:47.433
and the script in front of me.

01:01:48.870 --> 01:01:51.560
Johnston reasserted control at the point

01:01:51.560 --> 01:01:54.620
where the unknown seemed too strange,

01:01:54.620 --> 01:01:56.503
too wild for his audience.

01:01:58.100 --> 01:02:02.300
His lecture belonged to a
larger modernist project

01:02:02.300 --> 01:02:03.970
to teach the British,

01:02:03.970 --> 01:02:08.970
to view Jamaica as a well-ordered
domesticated landscape

01:02:09.900 --> 01:02:12.750
brimming with picturesque places.

01:02:12.750 --> 01:02:16.880
So he counted that unease
by setting his audience down

01:02:16.880 --> 01:02:20.083
by the cave river for a picnic.

01:02:22.100 --> 01:02:25.140
The lecture struck a canny balance

01:02:25.140 --> 01:02:29.669
between thrilling his
listeners and offering comfort

01:02:29.669 --> 01:02:34.500
and reassurance regularly reminding them

01:02:34.500 --> 01:02:39.500
that Jamaica was a benign
and a healthful paradise.

01:02:39.960 --> 01:02:44.090
One of the fairest countries
in the habitable earth,

01:02:44.090 --> 01:02:49.090
a land of picturesque
views and unrivaled beauty.

01:02:51.000 --> 01:02:54.140
In his lecture, the phrase,

01:02:54.140 --> 01:02:55.650
in what other country

01:02:55.650 --> 01:03:00.203
could you find was repeated many times.

01:03:01.520 --> 01:03:04.562
Jamaica, the audience constantly

01:03:04.562 --> 01:03:08.323
assured was a dream land.

01:03:11.040 --> 01:03:15.000
Jamaicans are revealed to be gardens,

01:03:15.000 --> 01:03:17.370
purveyors of abundance,

01:03:17.370 --> 01:03:21.130
barriers of the islands
agricultural riches

01:03:21.130 --> 01:03:23.830
for the dreamers consumption,

01:03:23.830 --> 01:03:27.680
presented in the neat
clean a tire that everyone

01:03:27.680 --> 01:03:30.360
