01:03:41.450 --> 01:03:45.810
As they hold balance and lift interview

01:03:45.810 --> 01:03:48.733
gigantic examples of produce.

01:03:49.610 --> 01:03:54.610
Viewers have reassured that
Jamaicans successfully handle

01:03:55.990 --> 01:04:00.223
