appear to be out of control.

01:04:02.680 --> 01:04:06.160
Offering up to the viewer
the fruits of their labor

01:04:06.160 --> 01:04:08.220
and the island,

01:04:08.220 --> 01:04:12.300
Jamaicans become people
who like the landscape

01:04:12.300 --> 01:04:16.300
