01:04:20.330 --> 01:04:24.700
The population of the new Jamaica is safe,

01:04:24.700 --> 01:04:28.950
willing and eager to
serve their islands bounty

01:04:28.950 --> 01:04:30.803
to future tourists.

01:04:33.120 --> 01:04:36.720
Johnston and his flickering images

01:04:36.720 --> 01:04:38.933
held his audience spellbound.

01:04:39.980 --> 01:04:43.560
This picture exhibits not only fair types

01:04:43.560 --> 01:04:47.250
