the Jamaican staff of life,

01:04:52.400 --> 01:04:54.560
the (indistinct)

01:04:55.445 --> 01:04:58.920
leaving even Jamaicans
and Jamaican produce

01:04:58.920 --> 01:05:00.833
seamlessly together.

01:05:03.380 --> 01:05:08.170
Johnston's voice rose
his head swept the Roman,

01:05:08.170 --> 01:05:11.860
his eyes sought to make direct contact,

01:05:11.860 --> 01:05:15.810
sorry, sought to make direct contact

01:05:15.810 --> 01:05:19.250
